# Example format for cookies.txt
# Add your Roblox .ROBLOSECURITY cookies, one per line
# 
# WARNING: These are sensitive credentials!
# Only use cookies from accounts you own or have permission to check
# 
# Example format (replace with your actual cookies):
# _|WARNING:-DO-NOT-SHARE-THIS.--Sharing-this-will-allow-someone-to-log-in-as-you-and-to-steal-your-ROBUX-and-items.|_
# _|WARNING:-DO-NOT-SHARE-THIS.--Sharing-this-will-allow-someone-to-log-in-as-you-and-to-steal-your-ROBUX-and-items.|_
#
# To use:
# 1. Rename this file to 'cookies.txt'
# 2. Replace the example cookies with your actual cookies
# 3. Run the checker: python roblox_cookie_checker_advanced.py
